{
  "_comment": [
    "Rules of scripts/treelab/brand-bundle.py: which 'cmux' in a built app's texts names the app",
    "(replaced by the brand name) and which is a technical name that stays (counted by class).",
    "Order of the classes: cli, gpl, commande, adresse, fichier; anything else is the app's name.",
    "cli_commands: first words of the internal CLI's commands (`cmux --help`), a command when quoted.",
    "prose_commands: commands written without quotes in upstream texts ('run cmux automation reload')."
  ],
